{"id":9687165,"sci":"Motacilla alba","inatName":"Motacilla alba","ar":"ذُعرَةٌ بيضاء","arAlt":["ذعرة بيضاء"],"en":"White Wagtail","local":"أبو فصادة","localNote":null,"group":null,"hunting":false,"fam":"Motacillidae","famAr":null,"ord":"Passeriformes","ordAr":"عصفوريات","iucn":"LC","status":"winter","months":[560,585,543,134,10,2,1,9,14,418,713,586],"presence":[0.94,0.79,0.62,0.14,0.01,0.01,0,0.02,0.02,0.44,1,0.97],"n":3575,"inat":13695,"inatN":212125,"ebird":"whiwag","summary":"الذُّعَرّة البيضاء أو الذُعَرَة البلقاء أو أم سَكَعْكَع أو أم عَجلان (الاسم العلمي: Motacilla alba) (بالإنجليزية: White Wagtail)‏ هو طائر صغير من الجواثم ينتمي لفصيلة التمرة. وهو طائر مهاجر شتوي شائع جداً في شهور الربيع، يعيش في المناطق الزراعية والحدائق الكبيرة وتجمعات المياه والمستنقعات، وأطراف الأودية والأنهار. سُمِّي هذا الطائر بالسلحوت لأنه يصدر صوتاً أو يسلحت بصوته، أي يصدر نغمة مثل «سِل سِل».","summaryEn":null,"wiki":"https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/ذعرة_بيضاء","arWiki":"https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%B0%D8%B9%D8%B1%D8%A9_%D8%A8%D9%8A%D8%B6%D8%A7%D8%A1","photos":[{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/39786089/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) ZTSurvival, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by ZTSurvival","lic":"cc-by-nc"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/122030228/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) Анна Голубева, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC-ND), uploaded by Анна Голубева","lic":"cc-by-nc-nd"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/2653533/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) Kim, Hyun-tae, some rights reserved (CC BY), uploaded by Kim, Hyun-tae","lic":"cc-by"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/3330790/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) Dr Caesar Sengupta, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Dr Caesar Sengupta","lic":"cc-by-nc"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/422290554/{s}.jpeg","a":"(c) laicathedino, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by laicathedino","lic":"cc-by-nc"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data